<title>USA: IDEXX Q1 net per share declines.</title>
<headline>IDEXX Q1 net per share declines.</headline>
<dateline>WESTBROOK, Maine 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.02		    $0.18</p>
<p> Net			    895		    6,960</p>
<p> Revs			60,534		   57,400</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  39,711		   39,362</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full name of company is IDEXX Laboratories Inc.</p>
<p>On an income-from-operations basis, Q1 1997 had a loss of $273,000, compared with a profit of $9.5 million for Q1 1996.</p>
<p>Net income results hurt by lower sales of veterinary testing instruments and other products, and program to reduce distributor inventories.</p>
</text>
